# --- Regenerated intermediates: committed artifacts are the rendered ones (.tex, images, PDF).
# Everything below is rebuilt by the stages in under a minute:
#   stage 5 -> results/analysis/*.csv       (the analysis tables)
#   stage 6/7 --prepare -> *_source.csv     (the per-table and per-figure source data)
# Run ./run_all.sh (or the individual stages) before compiling the manuscript.
results/analysis/
results/figures/*_source.csv
results/figures/fig4_values.csv
results/figures/*.provenance.txt
results/tables/*_source.csv
results/tables/*_source.csv.provenance.txt
results/tables/_table_specs.json
